      "text": "it eases the brake,"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.9099385,
      "end": 16.9099375,
      "text": "then squeezes again,"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.309943375,
      "end": 18.214692375,
      "text": "many times a second."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.61469825,
      "end": 19.79332325,
      "text": "So the\\Ntires keep rolling,"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.07898925,
      "end": 20.95994725,
      "text": "and they can still turn."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.359953125,
